  (lib_symbols)
  (text "Signal Scout base board rev C.4. Double-click a sheet box (or use the hierarchy navigator) to open it.\nNets carry their net class through their names (see the PCB README).\nExpander map (AW9523B): P0_0 UP, P0_1 DOWN, P0_2 LEFT, P0_3 RIGHT, P0_4 A, P0_5 B, P0_6 SPARE, P0_7 SIDE, P1_0 LOCK, P1_1 CHG_N, P1_2 SLED_WAKE, P1_3 DISP_PWR_EN, P1_4 GNSS_RST, P1_5..7 LED R/G/B (LED mode).\nChanges vs BOM v3: TPS63802 -> TPS63001 (fixed 3.3 V), KTD2026 removed (AW9523B LED mode), Fn key removed (not in CAD), J_DBG removed (native USB), NTC -> 10k fixed on TS." (at 25 150 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left top)) (uuid 26bb29c0-efbc-4e11-b827-6c0ec2d5414b))
